' F9 (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30 music remaster`): v1.2's
' `Application.OnProcess` toggles the music set while music is not off
' (`ToggleMusicMode`, Application.cs:225-238, 478-495): the remaster's set
' becomes the Amiga's and back, never off. Logged `f9: music amiga`, then
' `f9: music remaster`, in a place and on the world map alike (when the
' Amiga set is not on disk: `f9: nothing`). With `music off`: `f9: nothing`.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 30
f9                       ' the Amiga set
wait 5
esc                      ' the world map
wait 10
f9                       ' the remaster's set again
wait 5
quit
